Subject: [PATCH] swscale/arm: add experimental LLVM ARMv7 NEON JIT

Extension of patch 0007 to FFmpeg master e0e6ca1e29ef3f6b1e9b7d8656fe341eee8cf647.
Uses LLVM's ARM assembler, shared W^X allocation, and instruction-cache flush.
Preserves AAPCS32 registers and supports Thumb-2 callers. Fuses unsigned
8-bit planar/packed reads and writes, channel moves, clears, shifts and clamps.
Other operations and chroma resampling fall back to the available backends.
Requires explicit runtime selection through the frame-based scaling API;
the legacy sws_scale API does not use graph/UOp backends.

